📖 README — Day 28
🏥 Day 28 — Hospital Admission Readiness Simulator
#60DaysOfClaudeAI Challenge
A single-file interactive simulator for hospital admission coordinator training. Models real-world PA workflows, CMS compliance rules, and weighted readiness scoring.
🎯 What It Does
You play the role of a Hospital Admission Coordinator. Given a patient scenario — diagnosis, admission type, PA status, insurance, and attending physician — you navigate the full admission workflow to reach ≥90% readiness before the patient can be admitted.
