🔀 PA Branching Logic
Approved → Proceed with workflow
Pending → Follow Up / Upload Docs / Contact Physician
Denied → Review Reason → Contact Insurance → Submit Appeal → Simulate result
Successful Appeal → PA converts to Approved, score recalculates
🏥 Compliance Alerts
Observation triggers CMS 2-Midnight Rule banner + MOON notification requirement
Acute MI / CHF triggers InterQual/Milliman medical necessity notice
